{"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/OrigamiMappings","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swami\/origamimappings"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"What each Origami patch becomes in SwiftUI, so you know which construct — or which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","type":"reference"},{"text":" helper — to reach for.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Swami"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Origami to SwiftUI reference"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Origami’s patch graph and SwiftUI both describe how values flow and change over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"time, so the translations map onto SwiftUI’s own tools: computed properties for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pure math, gestures and ","type":"text"},{"code":"@State","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for interaction, ","type":"text"},{"code":"withAnimation","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for motion. Most","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patches land on a native SwiftUI construct. A few need a helper from the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"library, named after the patch it stands in for.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Patch → SwiftUI","anchor":"Patch-%E2%86%92-SwiftUI"},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Origami patch"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"SwiftUI","type":"